    "controller_support": "full",
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Excitement builds and magic fills the air as adventurers from across the realm gather, the time has come once again for the kingdom to host the most prestigious tournament of the realm!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2665450/extras/8f471cc341b20e34a93ce3eaf411dc52.poster.avif?t=1752711945\" width=600 height=204 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2665450/extras/8f471cc341b20e34a93ce3eaf411dc52.webm?t=1752711945\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2665450/extras/8f471cc341b20e34a93ce3eaf411dc52.mp4?t=1752711945\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>Gather your team and sign up for the tournament. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Decimate enemies, conquer objectives, and fight your way through powerful bosses to claim the crown and prove yourself as the most powerful adventurer in the realm! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2665450/extras/8f6203d94c04a44486d793f5a14ebc52.poster.avif?t=1752711945\" width=600 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2665450/extras/8f6203d94c04a44486d793f5a14ebc52.webm?t=1752711945\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2665450/extras/8f6203d94c04a44486d793f5a14ebc52.mp4?t=1752711945\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>Choose your character and plan your build before setting out for a variety of missions. While on these missions you will earn XP and be able to choose from a plethora of powerful rewards to help you complete the objective. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2665450/extras/43dee31cd1d8da261b3ce10d1e044ead.poster.avif?t=1752711945\" width=600 height=314 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2665450/extras/43dee31cd1d8da261b3ce10d1e044ead.webm?t=1752711945\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2665450/extras/43dee31cd1d8da261b3ce10d1e044ead.mp4?t=1752711945\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>Form an elite squad by teaming up with three companions, engaging in epic battles against enemies that dynamically scale to the strength of your group. This ensures an ever-present challenge, regardless of who you bring along.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2665450/extras/b7982cc176dad814b05fdd520a62b1d7.poster.avif?t=1752711945\" width=600 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2665450/extras/b7982cc176dad814b05fdd520a62b1d7.webm?t=1752711945\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2665450/extras/b7982cc176dad814b05fdd520a62b1d7.mp4?t=1752711945\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>Fight your way to the top and show that you and your companions stand as the unrivaled champions. Transcend not only within the kingdom but also on a global scale. The leaderboard meticulously tracks the fastest and most extraordinary triumphs in the tournament worldwide, solidifying your status as the kingdom's best heroes.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Excitement builds and magic fills the air as adventurers from across the realm gather, the time has come once again for the kingdom to host the most prestigious tournament of the realm!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2665450/extras/8f471cc341b20e34a93ce3eaf411dc52.poster.avif?t=1752711945\" width=600 height=204 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2665450/extras/8f471cc341b20e34a93ce3eaf411dc52.webm?t=1752711945\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2665450/extras/8f471cc341b20e34a93ce3eaf411dc52.mp4?t=1752711945\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>Gather your team and sign up for the tournament. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Decimate enemies, conquer objectives, and fight your way through powerful bosses to claim the crown and prove yourself as the most powerful adventurer in the realm! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2665450/extras/8f6203d94c04a44486d793f5a14ebc52.poster.avif?t=1752711945\" width=600 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2665450/extras/8f6203d94c04a44486d793f5a14ebc52.webm?t=1752711945\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2665450/extras/8f6203d94c04a44486d793f5a14ebc52.mp4?t=1752711945\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>Choose your character and plan your build before setting out for a variety of missions. While on these missions you will earn XP and be able to choose from a plethora of powerful rewards to help you complete the objective. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2665450/extras/43dee31cd1d8da261b3ce10d1e044ead.poster.avif?t=1752711945\" width=600 height=314 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2665450/extras/43dee31cd1d8da261b3ce10d1e044ead.webm?t=1752711945\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2665450/extras/43dee31cd1d8da261b3ce10d1e044ead.mp4?t=1752711945\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>Form an elite squad by teaming up with three companions, engaging in epic battles against enemies that dynamically scale to the strength of your group. This ensures an ever-present challenge, regardless of who you bring along.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2665450/extras/b7982cc176dad814b05fdd520a62b1d7.poster.avif?t=1752711945\" width=600 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2665450/extras/b7982cc176dad814b05fdd520a62b1d7.webm?t=1752711945\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2665450/extras/b7982cc176dad814b05fdd520a62b1d7.mp4?t=1752711945\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>Fight your way to the top and show that you and your companions stand as the unrivaled champions. Transcend not only within the kingdom but also on a global scale. The leaderboard meticulously tracks the fastest and most extraordinary triumphs in the tournament worldwide, solidifying your status as the kingdom's best heroes.</p>",
    "short_description": "A magical 3rd Person Shooter that can be played solo or with up to 3 friends, local or online. Complete missions and become the greatest team the arena has ever seen.",
